\title{Type Theory and Formal Proof}
\author{dhsorens}
\date{2025-08-29}
\meta{toc}{true}

\p{
    I am also interested more broadly in type theory and formal proof, especially as they relate to [proof assistants](dhsorens-000B). This has included some [preliminary work](dhsorens-0009) in [HoTT](dhsorens-hott) on the formal side, but ongoing work in the [formalization of mathematics](dhsorens-000Z) in [Lean](dhsorens-lean) is deeply interesting to me as a [peripheral development to my work](dhsorens-0017).
}

